<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id">- Borna New Testamnet</book>
  <para style="h">Yak'ob</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yak'ob</para>
  <para style="toc1">Yak'ob Woshts Wosho</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak'.</para>
  <para style="mt">Yak'ob Wosho</para>
  <para style="imt">Kindo</para>
  <para style="ip">Yak'ob woshan aawu aawon nobeyosh noon jishitu hasabiyotsi detsk b́ wotor b́ guut'ewwere dats jamats bad'ts tatse git naruwotsshe, guut'tsonwere dani telefo finats nijitsit malo, Krstiyani doyo detsonat ayhudi woto jishosh wotit keewwotsi kishde'er kitsit jewuri keewuotsn b́ t'intsiri, kashi jango, bogabogsho, fadewo, sheeng amalo, amani jangonat sheeng finon, albero b́ dowet gondonat sheengon, dani teleefo, atsatseyo fayeyi jango, bogtaana etonat b́ tooko dash detson k'oshuwotsats angshi jango, it'i jango k'amonat Ik' k'oni jangon, krstiyaniwots k'alosh boon geyit keewi jango ik ikon guut're.</para>
  <para style="ip">Woshan krstiyani beewotse imnetiyo finats b́jinet jango shaanidek'tni b́ kitsiri.</para>
  <para style="iot">Jamon mas'aafan b́detstso</para>
  <para style="io1">Kindo. 1:1</para>
  <para style="io1">Imnetiyonat Dani teleefon. 1:2-8</para>
  <para style="io1">Tugroonat gaalon. 1:9-11</para>
  <para style="io1">Fadeyo. 1:12-18</para>
  <para style="io1">Ik'o keewuts keewo k'eboonat finats jiitson. 1:19—2:13</para>
  <para style="io1">Amanonat finon. 2:14-26</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstiyaaniyonat bíalbeeron. 3:1-18</para>
  <para style="io1">Krstiyaaniwonat datsaann. 4:1—5:6</para>
  <para style="io1">K'osh k'osh naari keew jangosh imets izo. 5:7-20</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1"/>
  <para style="s">Jamo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">1:1 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 13:55">Mat. 13:55</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 6:3">Mar. 6:3</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 15:13">Wosh. 15:13</ref>; <ref loc="GAL 1:19">Gel. 1:19</ref> </char>
    </note> Dats jamats bad'ts tatse git jirwotssh Ik'onat doonzo Iyesus Krstos guutso wottso Yak'oboke wosheets jamó, jeno itsh wotowe.<verse eid="JAS 1:1"/></para>
  <para style="s">Imnetyonat Dani teleefon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2"/>Ti eshuwotso! k'osh k'osh naari fadewo itats b́bodor geenúshit keewwotsi it daatstsok'o woshde'er taawwere. <verse eid="JAS 1:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3"/>It imnetiyo b́fadewo k'amo itsh daatsituwo b́wottsok'owo dandek'etute. <verse eid="JAS 1:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4"/>K'amonowere it kup'o ik jago itsh b́shaprawo s'eenonat itn bodtswotsi woshituwo wotowe. <verse eid="JAS 1:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5"/>Ititse dani teleefo bísh b́shapts asho fa'e wotiyal Ik'o k'onuwe, Ik'onwere bísh imetwe, bí jametsosh shiitso bí aa'awo tewudi doon imetwo Izar Izeweriye. <verse eid="JAS 1:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6"/>Ernmó asho eegonor gito b́gímberawo amande'er k'onuwe, git gimbiru asho jongon gifniyeyat giwwtsts aatsk'aroniye bíariye. <verse eid="JAS 1:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7"/>Mannaari asho doonzoke ik jago b́daatsituwok'o bísh ark'aye. <verse eid="JAS 1:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8"/>Han b́wotituwere git níbo detst b́weerindatse hake baka bíetiruwoshe.<verse eid="JAS 1:8"/></para>
  <para style="s">Tugrets ashonat gaalets ashon geneúwo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9"/>B́ beewon dashan wotts eshuwo Ik'o damban bín b́ detsetwosh geneúwowe, <verse eid="JAS 1:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10"/>Ash gaalo bodi fuundok'o b́ ooshetuowotse b́ beewon dambaan wotts eshuwo Ik'o b́bewo dashan b́woshiyalor gene'úwowe, <verse eid="JAS 1:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">1:10-11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="ISA 40:6-7">Isa. 40:6-7</ref> </char></note> Aawo b́ k'ees'onton b́keshor bodo shuuk'iniye b́k'riti, b́ fúndonuwere ooyniye b́wutsiti, bíazisheengonwere t'afniye b́wutsiti, mank'owere gaalets asho b́fiinon b́jaakfere t'afniye b́wutsiti.<verse eid="JAS 1:11"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Ashaats bodet fadewo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12"/>Doonzo b́ taartsok'on bín shuntswotssh b́ imet kashi akililiyo b́ dek'etuwosh fadeyo k'amar kúp'it asho deereke. <verse eid="JAS 1:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13"/>Ik'o gond keewon noon b́ fadrawotse mank'o bíwere konnoru b́ fadrawotse asho b́ fadeyor «Ik'o taan fadre» etk'aye. <verse eid="JAS 1:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14"/>Ernmó asho ik ikon b́ fadeyir b́ took tewnon geetseyar bí ant'elcewore. <verse eid="JAS 1:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15"/>Haniyhakon tewunu bmaac'or morro shuwitwaniye. Morronu s'eenon bi eeniyakon k'iro shuwituwane.<verse eid="JAS 1:15"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16"/>Shuneets eshuwwotso! it ant'elcherawok'owa! <verse eid="JAS 1:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17"/>Sheengts imonat s'een wotts deer jamo Ik'okne, han b́weetuwe c'ishok'o wona wonewo deshaw shááni niho Ik'okne. <verse eid="JAS 1:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18"/>Ik'o bí azts jam shintswotsitse gawdek't ari aap'on noon shuure.<verse eid="JAS 1:18"/></para>
  <para style="s">Shishetso finats jitso</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19"/>Shuneets eshuwotso! han batk'ayere, ash jamo k'ebosh káártso, noonkeewonat fayosh mango wotowe. <verse eid="JAS 1:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20"/>Ash fayo Ik'i kááwo daatsiratse. <verse eid="JAS 1:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21"/>Hansha kiimonat weerigondi ayonowere ok k'aúbayr Ik'o it nibots b́ toktsonat it kasho kashiyo falitu aap'man it tooko dashan detson de'ere.<verse eid="JAS 1:21"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22"/>Ik'i aap'tso finats jiitswere bako it tooko dashfetsr shish mec'ro shishfwotsi wotk'ayere. <verse eid="JAS 1:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23"/>Ik' aap'ts aap'o finats jiitsraw asho bín bíazeets shiitso mastayiton bek'iru ashok'oyiye, <verse eid="JAS 1:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24"/>Ashaan b́shiitso mastyiton b́s'iliyakon ametuwe, awuk'o b́wottsok'owo manoor batni b́k'riti. <verse eid="JAS 1:24"/><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25"/>Wotowa eree nas' kishit b́ nemo sheengshr s'iilr bín kup'ituwo bínowere shiir baterawo, finats jitsitu asho b́ finon deereke b́ wotiti.<verse eid="JAS 1:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26"/>Bí albero korde'aniyere Ik'o Ik'irwe eteet asho b́ tookoniye b́ dashiri, b́ ik'iyonwere k'awuntso deshatse. <verse eid="JAS 1:26"/><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27"/>Ik'o niho shinatse s'ayinonat kimaw hayimanotiyo, nihonat indo k'irts nanaúwotssh, aaninu bokenih k'irts máátsuwotssh bo kic'or boon tep'o, b́ tookonowere datsanatsi kimatse kordek'oniye.<verse eid="JAS 1:27"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1"/>
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2"/>
  <para style="s">Ash bogabogsho b́geyirawok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1"/>Tieshuwotso! mangts doonzo Iyesus Krstosn amaniruwotsitna wotiyal iko ikoniyere bogfe eton asho bogabogshk'ayere. <verse eid="JAS 2:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2"/>Git ashuwots it kakuweyiru bewokok weetune, iko b́kishi jabots awntsi k'ubelo geddek'tsonat tah sheengo tah dek'tso gaaletska, k'osho kiimts tahidoro tahts tugretska, <verse eid="JAS 2:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3"/>Sheengiru tah tahdek'ts asho mangiyon «Sheeng beyokanats bede'e» it eteti. Tugretsonmó «Neyere manoke need'owe, wee ttufishiroots bede'e» it eteti, <verse eid="JAS 2:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4"/>Eshe, mank'oon it dagotse k'osh k'oshewonat bogabogshr angisho it angshituwok'o itsh be'eratsa?<verse eid="JAS 2:4"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5"/>Shuneets eshuwotso! k'ewere, Ik'o amanon galetswotsi bo wotitwok'onat bín shuntswotssho b́ jangits mengsto bo naatetwok'o datsanatsi tugretswotsi marat'de'atsa? <verse eid="JAS 2:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6"/>Itmó tugretswotsiye it gac'iri, itn dadaat angshi moo maants iti geetsirwots gaaletswotsiyoshna? <verse eid="JAS 2:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7"/>It bín it s'eegeyiru sheeng shúútso c'ashiruwots bonoshna?<verse eid="JAS 2:7"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:8 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lew. 19:18</ref> </char>
    </note> «K'osh asho ntookok'o woshde'er shune» et S'ayin mas'aafotse guut'etso Ik'i mengestitsi nemo it s'eentsiyal sheenge it finiri. <verse eid="JAS 2:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9"/>Ash dago it boga bogshiyalmó morre it finiri, nemo it beshiruwotse iti k'oretute. <verse eid="JAS 2:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10"/>Asho tzaziwotsitsere iko gaahr oorts jamwotsi b́ s'eentsiyal dab jamwotsi b́ gaktsok'owe taaweti. <verse eid="JAS 2:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-14">Kesh. 20:13-14</ref>; <ref loc="DEU 5:17-18">Iwi. 5:17-18</ref> </char></note> «Wido amk'aye» etts doonzo mank'o «Ud'k'aye» etre, mansh wido amo nk'azal dab n ud'iyal nemo gaakrne. <verse eid="JAS 2:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12"/>S'ayin kishit nemoke angsho dek'osh fa'a ashuwotskok'o keewwere, mank'owere k'aluwere. <verse eid="JAS 2:12"/><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13"/>Ik' angsho maarraw ashuwotssh mhreti woshratse, b́ wotefere mhretiyo angsho daa'ituwe.<verse eid="JAS 2:13"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Imnetiyonat finon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14"/>T eshúwotso! asho imnetiyo detsfe bí etal, ando aani b́ imnetiyo sheeng finon kitso b́ k'azal eebi bísh b́ k'aliti? B́ imnetiyo bín kashiyosh falituwa? <verse eid="JAS 2:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15"/>Bo tahituwonat bo meetuwo deshaw eeshuwotsnat mishúwotsn bobeyal, <verse eid="JAS 2:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16"/>ititsere iko bo beyosh geyit keewo imaniyere «Jeenon ameree! itsh k'ec'ee! woorwere!» bí etal eebi boosh b́ k'aliti? <verse eid="JAS 2:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17"/>Mank'o sheeng fin deshaw imnetiyo k'irkee.<verse eid="JAS 2:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18"/>Ernmó «Nee imnetiyo detsfne, taawere sheeg fino detsfe» etetuwo b́ beyal, «N imnetiyo finalo taash kitsuwe, taawere t finon t imnetiyo kitsituwe» etetuwe. <verse eid="JAS 2:18"/><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19"/>Nee «Ik Ik'o fa'ee» etaat amanirune, sheenge, amanonere Fo'erawwotswor amanirune, shatonowere k'ewirune. <verse eid="JAS 2:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20"/>Nee dartsano! imnetiyo finalo k'awuntso<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:20 </char><char style="fqa" closed="false">K'awtsalka: </char><char style="ft">Etirwan yoots brani mas'afwots k'irka etfe. </char></note> b́ deshawok'o danosh geefiya? <verse eid="JAS 2:20"/><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:21 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 22:1-14">Aze. 22:1-14</ref> </char></note> Nonihi Abraham b́ naayi Yishak'i wosh t'intseyru t'arap'ezats Ik'osh wosho woshdek't b́ t'intsor kááw b́ wot b́ finonalneya? <verse eid="JAS 2:21"/><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22"/>Eshe imnetiyo finonton ikoke b́ teshtsok'onat imnetiyo finon s'een b́ wottsok'o bek'irute? <verse eid="JAS 2:22"/><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Aze. 15:6</ref>; <ref loc="2CH 20:7">2 Zen. 20:7</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 41:8">Isa. 41:8</ref> </char></note> S'ayin Mas'aafotse «Abraham Ik'o bí amani, b́ imnetiyonwere kááw wotat bísh b́ taaweyi» ett aap'ets aap'o s'eenbwutsi, hank'on Ik' shun ash b́woti etiyi. <verse eid="JAS 2:23"/><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24"/>Eshe asho b́ kááwit imneti mec'ron b́woterawon finono dabde'er b́wotsok'o bek'etúnee.<verse eid="JAS 2:24"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">2:25 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Iya. 2:1-21</ref> </char>
    </note> Widetsu Ra'ab Isra'elitse woshetswotsi b mootse bdek'or k'osh weeron boametuwok'o bwoshor bi bfinonon kááweratsna?<verse eid="JAS 2:25"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26"/>Kashaatse k'aleets meetso k'irkee, mank'owere finatse k'aleets imnetiyo k'irkee.<verse eid="JAS 2:26"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2"/>
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3"/>
  <para style="s">Albero kordek'i jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1"/>Ti eshuwotso! noo danifuwotsi wottsuwots iki bogts angsho node'k'etwok'o itdantsotse ititse ayuwots danifuwotsi wotk'ayine. <verse eid="JAS 3:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2"/>No noúnets aayote nosheeliri, b́ noon keew keewon darrawo bí bí ats jamo kordek' falituwo ik jag bí atse daatseraw ashe. <verse eid="JAS 3:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3"/>Farsho noosh bí azazetwok'o b́ nonots lugamo nogedeti, mank'oon bíats jamó no shuntsok jiishituwone. <verse eid="JAS 3:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4"/>Markabo awuk'o een b́ wotiyaloru jong angon b́ jookewor, markab jokirwo bir múk'naún b́ shuntso maants b́ jiishiti. <verse eid="JAS 3:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5"/>Mank'owere alberu muk'na'a atsi kayu wotefetsat een een keewwotsn bit'iri, een gemo b́mis'fo taw muk'na'úne. <verse eid="JAS 3:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6"/>Alberunu tawok'oyiye. Alberu noatsi kaywotsitse daatseru gond datsuniye. Ats jamats aldetstsonat noats jamo bi awaashiti. Gahanemitse keshiru tawok'o nobee jamo bmitsiri. <verse eid="JAS 3:6"/><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7"/>Datsatsi s'otswotsnat kafuwots, datsatse getseyirwotsnat aats k'arotse sha'iru azeets jamwots ashon sezewo falitune, andoor sezeerne. <verse eid="JAS 3:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8"/>Wotowa bako albero sezo falituwo konuwor aaliye, úd'it marziyo bín s'eentsonat kashdek'o biitse deshaw gond keewniye. <verse eid="JAS 3:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:9 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="GEN 1:26">Aze. 1:26</ref> </char></note> Bín no nihi Ik'o noúdiri, mank'owere bín Ik'i aron azeets ashuwotsi noc'ashiri. <verse eid="JAS 3:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10"/>Noon ikotse údonat c'ashon keshirune, tieshuwotso! han b́ woto geyiratse. <verse eid="JAS 3:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11"/>Aats t'up' ikotse úshosh wotit shaaw aatsonat s'aam aatson t'up'osh falituwa? <verse eid="JAS 3:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12"/>Ti eshuwotso! belesi mito woyira eteets mit shúwo shuwosh falatse. Wee woyini bos'o Belesi shuwo shuwosh falatse? Mank'o s'aam aatsotse shaaw aatso keyatse.<verse eid="JAS 3:12"/></para>
  <para style="s">Daronat datsatsi dani teleefo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13"/>It dagotsere dan teleefonat t'iwints detsts asho kone? Dani teleefonat b́tooko dashan detson b́fiintsfino b́sheng beyon kitsuwe. <verse eid="JAS 3:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14"/>Wotowabako s'aamts okooronat b́ took shuno it nibots fa'e wotiyal it'k'ayere, arikeewatsowere kootk'ayere. <verse eid="JAS 3:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15"/>Dani teleefan b́ daatseti, datsuwatse meetsatse, Dablosokna bako Ik'onaaliye. <verse eid="JAS 3:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16"/>Okooronat took shunon bobeyokoke dimbironat gond fin jamwots beetune. <verse eid="JAS 3:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17"/>Wotowaere Ik'oke daatset dani teleefo shin shino s'ayine, manats dabrnuwere jeenon s'eents, doo, maneyo, mhretiyo, sheeng shuwo bín s'eentso, bogabogshoonat gitalberetsi woto biitse deshawoniye. <verse eid="JAS 3:17"/><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18"/>Jeen be shunts ashuwots jeeno shoohr kááwi shuwo kakuwitune.<verse eid="JAS 3:18"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3"/>
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4"/>
  <para style="s">Datsanatsi gondonton kod'ewo k'azi jango</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1"/>It dagotse fa'a kes'onat fayon awuke waake? It atsotse kaariru it meetsi tewunaatsnosha? <verse eid="JAS 4:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2"/>Ik keewo daatsosh tewunirute, ernmó daatsatste, asho úd'irute okoorirute eree daatsatste, fayeyirute, koyeyirute. Ik'o it k'onraawotsnowere it geyiru keewo daatsatste. <verse eid="JAS 4:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3"/>Ik'o it k'oniyaloru Ik' it k'onts mansh aaniyo daatso itk'azir it k'oniru keewo meets geneeúwats jiitsosh gond asaabiyon Ik'o it k'onirwooshe. <verse eid="JAS 4:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4"/>It widetswotso! datsu shuntso Ik'i t'alato b́wottsok'owo danatsteya? Eshe konwor datsunton shune geyiruwo b́tooko Ik'i t'alato b́woshoniye. <verse eid="JAS 4:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5"/>Ando S'ayin mas'aafotse «Ik'i okooro, bí no gitsots b́ k'eezts shayiro b́ s'uzsh no wotitwok'oye» bí ettso datsmec'reya? <verse eid="JAS 4:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6"/>B́ wotiyaloru s'ayin mas'fo «Ik'o bog taana etirwotsi k'efituwe, dash took detsirwotsshomó b́ s'aato imetwe» b́ ettsosh Ik' imet s'aato jamoniyere boge.<verse eid="JAS 4:6"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7"/>Mansh Ik'osh keewewere dablosnoweer k'efoore, bíwere itatsere okaan wos'etuwe. <verse eid="JAS 4:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8"/>Ik'ok t'inere, bíewere itok t'inetwe, it morretsuwotso! it kishuwotsi s'ayntsuwere, it hakebaka etiruwotso! it nibo s'ayintswere. <verse eid="JAS 4:8"/><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9"/>Kic'oore, shiyanowere, efere, it miis'o eepo maants, it gene'o shiyano maants wonewe. <verse eid="JAS 4:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10"/>Doonzo shinatse it tooko dashan deshere, bíwere dambaan itn tuuzitwe.<verse eid="JAS 4:10"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Ashaats angsh k'azo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11"/>Eshuwotso, it atsatsewo oonek'ayere, ash oonitwo wee ashaats angshituwo neme b́ ooniri, nematse b́ angshiri, nemats n angshiyalomo dab angshtsi nwoti bako nemó s'eentsitk neenaliye. <verse eid="JAS 4:11"/><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12"/>Nem imetwonat angshituwo Ik' ikoniye, woriyosho t'afiyoshowere falituwoniye b́ s'uziye, eshe k'osh ashaats angshituwo kene neewo?<verse eid="JAS 4:12"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Bogtaana etotse atso kordek'o b́geyituwok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13"/>It «Hambets wee yaats hank'o wotts kitots amr manoke worwot iko beetwone, jaahrnwere oorshitwone» etiruwots itatso korde'ere. <verse eid="JAS 4:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:13-14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 27:1">Ari. 27:1</ref> </char></note> Yaats wotituwo danatste, it beyo eebi? ikonoto be'eyar il t'afit daawnok'o itne. <verse eid="JAS 4:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15"/>Maniyeremó eto iti b́geyituwo «Doonzo bíere nobeetka wotiyal han wee ekeewi k'alituwone» etoniye itsh geyiti. <verse eid="JAS 4:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16"/>Itmó han it etfk'oon bognona etoone it it'iri, han naari it' jamoniye gonde.<verse eid="JAS 4:16"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17"/>Eshe sheeng keewo k'alo danfetsr k'alraaw asho k'al b́k'azo morre bíats b́wotiti.<verse eid="JAS 4:17"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4"/>
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5"/>
  <para style="s">Gaaletswotssh boatso korbodek'etwok'o b́wooshtsok'o</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1"/>Andoor it gaaletswotso! aab waa k'ewere, weerali gond bek'o it ats b́weetwotse kuhar efere. <verse eid="JAS 5:1"/><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2"/>It gaaljamo ok'wutsere. It tahonowere biliyon meewtsere. <verse eid="JAS 5:2"/><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:2-3 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MAT 6:19">Mat. 6:19</ref> </char></note> It awntsonat it ambaron ajwutsere, bí aj ajonwere gawe itats b́wotiti, it meetsonowere tawok'owe b́meetiye, s'uwaatsi aaw hanotsitse ay gaalo ko'irte. <verse eid="JAS 5:3"/><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:4 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="DEU 24:14-15">Iwi. 24:14-15</ref> </char></note> Hamb it tarootse k'es'roon jints fini ashuwots k'awuntso bik' itde'e bokuhi k'ááro b́shiyeyri, mááy ko'iruwots k'ááronowere dari kes'i jirwots doonzo waazats bodrere. <verse eid="JAS 5:4"/><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5"/>Datsatsi it beyo b́dowere it shuntsok' beerte. It tooko shukosh k'aniyets miinzok'o shopidek'rte. <verse eid="JAS 5:5"/><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6"/>Kááwo ats angshat úd'rte, bíwere itn k'eferatse.<verse eid="JAS 5:6"/></para>
  <para style="b"/>
  <para style="s">Doonzo aanar b́woo k'amoon koto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7"/>Eshuwwotso! eshe haniyak doonzo b́waafetsosh k'amoon korere, goshtso b́ dats shintsonat ili awusho b́ daatsfetsosh k'amefetsr mangts k'awunts detstso b́ datsi shuwo kotfe. <verse eid="JAS 5:7"/><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8"/>Itwere mank'o k'amoore, doozo weyi aawo b́karntsotse it nibon kup'ore.<verse eid="JAS 5:8"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9"/>Eshúwotso! iti k'orerawok'o, it ats atseyo mumundk'ayere, Hamb eshe angshituwo fengeshatse need'wtsere. <verse eid="JAS 5:9"/><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10"/>Eshúwotso, doonzo shútson keewts nebiyatiyots gond bek'o k'amoon dek'on bo artsok'o danere. <verse eid="JAS 5:10"/><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:11 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="JOB 1:21-22">Iyo. 1:21-22</ref>; <ref loc="JOB 2:10">2:10</ref>; <ref loc="PSA 103:8">Dub. 103:8</ref> </char></note> Dabnu k'amoon kúp'ts manots «Derekne» etiruwone boosha, Iyob awuk'o b́ k'amtsok'o shishrte. doononwere il bísh b́ k'alts sheeng keewo bek'rte, mannowere doonzo maartsonat maac' nefetso b́ wottsok'o bek'rte.<verse eid="JAS 5:11"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:12 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="MAT 5:34-37">Mat. 5:34-37</ref> </char>
    </note> Eshúwotso! b́jamon daron wotowa datson jam keewon keewonoru taark'ayere, it keewo ee eta wotiyal arikon ee eto wotowe, woteratse wotiyal arikon woteratse erere, mank'o woto b́ k'azalomó it ats angshetuwe.<verse eid="JAS 5:12"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13"/>Ititse bí ats kic' bodts asho b́ beyal Ik'o k'onuwe, geneúts asho b́ beyal Ik'o udefetsr dúwe. <verse eid="JAS 5:13"/><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:14 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="MRK 6:13">Mar. 6:13</ref> </char></note> Ititsere shodts asho b́ beyal Ik' maa eenashuwotsi bíyok s'eede'e, boowere shodts manats doonzo Iyesus shútson zeyito furr Ik'o k'onune. <verse eid="JAS 5:14"/><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15"/>Hank'o imnetiyats need'ts Ik' k'ono shodts man kashituwe, Doonzonu b́ shodotse bín kashituwe, b́ fints morro b́ beyalo bísh orowa etetuwe. <verse eid="JAS 5:15"/><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16"/>Mansh it kashituwok'o it morro it ats atsewosh kewewore, iko k'oshosh Ik'o k'onuwe, kááw ash Ik' k'ono ay k'awuntso daatsit ango detsfe, <verse eid="JAS 5:16"/><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:17 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="1KI 17:1">1 Naash. 17:1</ref>; <ref loc="1KI 18:1">18:1</ref> </char></note> Eliyas nonk'o ashe b́ teshi, wotowa bako awusho b́ búyawok'o kúp'shdek't b́ k'oni keez natonat worwoti badosh datsats eegoru awusho búyatse.<verse eid="JAS 5:17"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18"/>
    <note caller="-" style="x">
      <char style="xo" closed="false">5:18 </char>
      <char style="xt">
        <ref loc="1KI 18:24-45">1 Naash. 18:24-45</ref> </char>
    </note> Aaninwere Ik'o b́ k'onre daro awusho b́ imi, datsunuwere aani shúwo b imi.<verse eid="JAS 5:18"/></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19"/>T eshúwotso! ititsere iko ari keewi weratseere b́ keshal k'osho ari weero maants bín bí aaniyal, <verse eid="JAS 5:19"/><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20"/><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">5:20 </char><char style="xt"><ref loc="PRO 10:12">Ari. 10:12</ref>; <ref loc="1PE 4:8">1 P'et'. 4:8</ref> </char></note> morretso b́ darts weeratse bí aaniyal, morretso kashu k'irotse b́kashituwok'onat ay morrosh orowa eto bísh b́ daatsituwok'o dande'e.<verse eid="JAS 5:20"/></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5"/>
</usx>
